{"unit_id":"QiE2035__dsh-llm-headers#feature-1","repo":"QiE2035/dsh-llm-headers","commit":"9565595b15ec864eb3e523c567798ebd940dad4a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-headers 的功能「匹配请求注入请求头」：对 URL 包含任一配置子串的 fetch 请求设置用户指定的 HTTP Headers，覆盖同名值并保留其他头。插件加载时启用，默认匹配 /chat/completions。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/fetch-proxy.ts:58-75","src/index.ts:40-47"]}
